estyle needs.</li><li>Spacious Designs &amp; High-End Finishes – Prioritizing privacy, luxury, and functionality, with meticulously crafted interiors.</li><li>Comprehensive Recreational Facilities – State-of-the-art sports complexes, running &amp; cycling tracks, kids’ play areas, and lush green parks to promote an active lifestyle.</li><li>Strategic Location – Located in Sharjah, with easy access to Dubai and major landmarks, including Dubai International Airport, Sharjah Airport, Al Zahia Mall, and University City.</li></ul>","design_title":null},"location_tile":{"id":1399,"cta":{"id":2174,"icon":null,"menu":null,"cta_label":"Get more information","isExternal":false,"custom_link":"#payment-plans"},"image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Al_Tay_Hills_in_Sharjah_UAE_b00ffe5188.jpg","hash":"Al_Tay_Hills_in_Sharjah_UAE_b00ffe5188","name":"Al Tay Hills in Sharjah UAE"},"style":null,"title":"Al Tay Hills at Sharjah, UAE – A Tranquil Community Located Between Dubai and Sharjah","heading":"Location","bg_color":"blue","add_place":[],"image_fit":null,"img_align":"left","video_url":null,"icon_stats":[],"description":"<p>Strategically located in the Al Tay area near Sharjah Grand Mosque and Emirates Road, Al Tay Hills offers seamless connectivity to key landmarks in both Sharjah and Dubai. Residents enjoy convenient access to Dubai International Airport, Downtown Dubai, and Sharjah International Airport, making commuting effortless. Beyond its prime location, Al Tay Hills boasts a remarkable natural feature—the UAE’s longest Green River, stretching over 2.5 km, creating a serene and picturesque environment that enhances the community’s appeal.</p><ul><li>5 Minutes to Suyoh Mall</li><li>7 Minutes to Iconic Sharjah Mosque</li><li>12 Minutes to Sharjah University City</li><li>12 Minutes to Zahia City Centre</li><li>15 Minutes to Sharjah Airport</li><li>20 Minutes to Dubai International Airport (DXB)</li><li>25 Minutes to Downtown Dubai</li></ul>